iv class="t m0 xa1 h7 y200 ff3 fs2 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _16"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">结点代表事件<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(ev<span class="_ _1"></span>ent)<span class="ff4">，有向边代表活动<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>(activity)<span class="ff4">。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 xa1 h7 y201 ff3 fs2 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _16"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">有向边的权代表活动持续时间<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(duration)</span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 xa1 h7 y202 ff3 fs2 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.<span class="_ _16"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">入边代表的活动已经完成，出边代表的活动可以开始。</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h7 y203 ff4 fs2 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">关键路径问题的求解步骤：</div><div class="t m0 xa1 h7 y204 ff3 fs2 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _16"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">事件<span class="_ _f"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑖<span class="_ _c"> </span></span>的最早发生时间<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑒<span class="_ _d"></span>𝑎𝑟<span class="_ _15"></span>𝑙<span class="_ _d"></span>𝑖<span class="_ _1a"></span>𝑒<span class="_ _d"></span>𝑠<span class="_ _d"></span>𝑡<span class="_ _15"> </span><span class="ffb">(</span>𝑖<span class="_ _1a"></span><span class="ffb">)<span class="_ _d"></span></span></span>：从开始结点<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑠<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>到结点<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑖<span class="_ _c"> </span></span>的最长路径长度。</span></div><div class="t m0 x6 hc y4c ffa fs2 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _49"> </span><span class="fc6"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">12 </span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _49"> </span><span class="fc8"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
